      "ask": "P2: Strict UTF-8 decoding of an existing .gitignore now makes `reflex init` crash on legacy non-UTF-8 files that previously loaded fine. Consider catching UnicodeDecodeError here and reporting a clear warning or error that names the file, instead of letting the exception abort init.",
