      "ask": "**Existing files stop initialization** If an existing `.gitignore` contains `caf\u00e9/` saved as cp1252, this UTF-8 read raises an uncaught `UnicodeDecodeError` and stops `reflex init`. Earlier Reflex versions could read and write that file using the Windows locale. The same change affects existing `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` files. Keep UTF-8 for writes, but add a fallback for legacy reads and a regression test.",
